config TESTING_ENCFS_EXTENDED
	bool "EncFS interrupted-write recovery fixture and Vela FS regression"
	default n
	depends on ENCFSMGR
	---help---
		Enable deterministic prepare/verify/churn commands on a dedicated
		EncFS test volume. The host may deliberately kill its emulator while
		churn runs; this simulates a process interruption, not hardware power loss.
		Also build the bounded Vela append/read loop from tests/testcases.
